# Geography Page — Cascade Selector Build Plan
**One table drives everything. Three slicers (Topic → Indicator → Demographic) cascade automatically because all three columns live in the same table.**

---

## ⚠️ Before You Start — Verify These Two Things

1. **Go to Data view → `dim_dem_category`** and confirm the exact spelling of values in `group_label` and any category type column. The strings in the table below must match *exactly* or the demographic rows will return blank on the map.

2. **Check `fact_acs_wi_county` or your earnings table** for median earnings columns. This data comes from ACS Table B24022 (not C24010 — C24010 has counts, not earnings). If you have not loaded median earnings data yet, the Economy rows will return blank until that table is added.

---

